  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 10,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We can't survive another season like this,\"",
        "line": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 12,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The other tribes\u2014\"",
        "line": 21
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 15,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We could migrate,\"",
        "line": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 17,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And enter Forest Giant territory? Desert lands? They barely tolerate our presence at inter-tribal gatherings. They won't welcome refugees who represent everything they blamed for the ritual's cost.\"",
        "line": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 26,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I am Enlil,\"",
        "line": 44
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 28,
      "actor": "Korrhan",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What arrangement?\"",
        "line": 47
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 29,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Your tribe requires resources: healing for ritual-damaged physiology, territory at sustainable altitudes, security against potential retaliation from other tribes who blame you for the convergence's cost. We require: cooperation in maintaining Needle infrastructure, intelligence regarding other Giant populations, access to mountain territories for monitoring operations.\"",
        "line": 49
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 34,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And if we refuse?\"",
        "line": 56
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 35,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You die slowly. Across perhaps three generations. The ritual damage is too severe for natural healing, and the other tribes won't provide the aid required for recovery. Your isolation\u2014carefully cultivated across three thousand years of subtle programming\u2014has ensured that you face this choice alone.\"",
        "line": 58
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 39,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You orchestrated our destruction to force this choice.\"",
        "line": 64
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 40,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We created conditions where you would make the choice freely. There is distinction. We don't require slaves who obey because compulsion leaves no alternative. We prefer collaborators who recognize that our purposes occasionally align with their survival.\"",
        "line": 66
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 49,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"If we accept... what happens to the other tribes?\"",
        "line": 78
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 50,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We continue pressure operations. Deploy additional creatures during the Third Coming. Gradually reduce their populations and capabilities until either they accept similar arrangements or prove insufficiently useful to maintain. Your cooperation accelerates that timeline. Your intelligence regarding their territories, their capabilities, their fault lines makes subjugation more efficient.\"",
        "line": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 51,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And if they discover our betrayal?\"",
        "line": 82
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 62,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I need time to consult with my tribe.\"",
        "line": 96
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 63,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You have three days. After which we withdraw our offer and allow natural consequences to proceed. Your choice, freely made. We respect that freedom even as we calculate its inevitable outcome.\"",
        "line": 98
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 69,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We become what we resisted. We betray everything the Garden represented. We trade principles for survival and make ourselves into cautionary tales that will poison Giant cooperation for thousands of years.\"",
        "line": 109
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 71,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Or we maintain principles while our children die slowly,\"",
        "line": 113
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 73,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The other tribes already judge us,\"",
        "line": 116
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 75,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we've already lost what we'd be betraying,\"",
        "line": 119
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 78,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Vote,\"",
        "line": 124
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 93,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They chose them,\"",
        "line": 147
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 95,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We blamed them,\"",
        "line": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 96,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"So this is our fault?\"",
        "line": 152
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 97,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is the Queen's design, executed perfectly across three thousand years of patient manipulation. She planted lies that isolated them. She deployed Gruulith specifically to break them. She knew the ritual would fracture alliances along existing suspicions. And she calculated that when we blamed them for requiring rescue, they would hear confirmation that they had always been separate, always been judged, always been alone.\"",
        "line": 154
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 103,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And the Sundering is complete,\"",
        "line": 162
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 105,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Can it be healed? In time, can we\u2014\"",
        "line": 165
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 106,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No,\"",
        "line": 167
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 137,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Departure authorization,\"",
        "line": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 148,
      "actor": "Torhh",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We failed,\"",
        "line": 229
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 149,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We tried,\"",
        "line": 231
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 151,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then what do we do for the next three thousand years? Watch the tribes isolate further? See the Ash Giants become exactly what the golden ones needed them to be? Wait for the Third Coming to test whether we've learned anything from this disaster?\"",
        "line": 234
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 152,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We maintain friendship,\"",
        "line": 236
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 153,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And if no such beings ever emerge? If the Fifth Coming arrives and finds Giants still fractured, still isolated, still carrying suspicions that feel organic because no one remembers they were planted?\"",
        "line": 238
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 154,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we'll have failed permanently,\"",
        "line": 240
      }
    }
  ],
